# Every text file is stored with LF in git and checked out with LF.
#
# Without this, one machine writes CRLF and the other LF, and every file either person
# touches shows as fully rewritten. On 2026-09-20 that was 8376 changed lines, none of
# them real. Editors on Windows handle LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.npy binary
*.ico binary
